        "custom_liquid_TxTjYf": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%} 1) Calcular porcentajes {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- capture green_percent -%}{% render 'discount-label', product: product, mode: 'percent' %}{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- capture red_percent -%}{% render 'daily-discount-label', product: product, mode: 'percent' %}{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- assign gp = green_percent | strip | plus: 0 -%}\n{%- assign rp = red_percent | strip | plus: 0 -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} 2) Debug visible solo en el editor {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if request.design_mode -%}\n  <div style=\"border:1px dashed #999;padding:8px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:6px;background:#fcfcfc;color:#333;font-size:12px;\">\n    <div><strong>Debug descuentos PDP</strong></div>\n    <div>gp (verde): <code>{{ gp }}</code> | rp (rojo): <code>{{ rp }}</code></div>\n    <div>Tags del producto: <code>{{ product.tags | join: ', ' }}</code></div>\n    <div>Colecciones del producto: {% for c in product.collections %}<code>{{ c.handle }}</code>{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %}</div>\n    <div>Nota: el rojo solo aplica si hoy coincide con sus reglas de día y tags (ej. VINOS el sábado).</div>\n    <div>Debug verde (reglas / match / fechas):</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:#fff;border-radius:4px;margin-top:4px;\">\n      {% render 'discount-label', product: product %}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} 3) Pintar solo el ganador (empate: rojo) {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if rp > gp and rp > 0 -%}\n  {% render 'daily-discount-label', product: product %}\n{%- elsif gp > rp and gp > 0 -%}\n  {% render 'discount-label', product: product %}\n{%- elsif gp == rp and gp > 0 -%}\n  {% render 'daily-discount-label', product: product %}\n{%- endif -%}"
          }
        },
        "custom_liquid_f48QiT": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"custom-pum m-0 mb-10\">\n{%- comment %} \n  1. Obtener y convertir el factor (\"432,0\" → 432.0) \n{% endcomment -%}\n{%- assign factor_text = product.metafields.custom.factor_unidad_de_medida.value | default: \"1,0\" -%}\n{%- assign factor = factor_text | replace: \",\", \".\" | plus: 0 -%}\n\n{%- comment %} \n  2. Convertir el precio a decimal (ej: $50.000 COP → 50000.0) \n{% endcomment -%}\n{%- assign precio = product.price | divided_by: 100.0 -%}\n\n{%- comment %} \n  3. Calcular PUM (precio / factor) y redondear a 2 decimales \n{% endcomment -%}\n{%- assign pum = precio | divided_by: factor | round: 2 -%}\n\n{%- comment %} \n  4. Formatear el resultado para mostrar 2 decimales (ej: 39.58) \n  - Si el resultado es 39.5, forzar \"39.50\"\n{% endcomment -%}\n{%- assign pum_parts = pum | split: \".\" -%}\n{%- if pum_parts.size == 1 -%}\n  {%- assign pum_formatted = pum | append: \".00\" -%}\n{%- else -%}\n  {%- assign decimal_digits = pum_parts[1] | size -%}\n  {%- if decimal_digits == 1 -%}\n    {%- assign pum_formatted = pum | append: \"0\" -%}\n  {%- else -%}\n    {%- assign pum_formatted = pum -%}\n  {%- endif -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n<div class=\"icon-pum\"><?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<svg id=\"Layer_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 384\">\n  <!-- Generator: Adobe Illustrator 29.5.1, SVG Export Plug-In . SVG Version: 2.1.0 Build 141)  -->\n  <defs>\n    <style>\n      .st0 {\n        fill: #6d7a84;\n      }\n\n      .st1 {\n        fill: #f45858;\n      }\n\n      .st2 {\n        fill: #fff;\n      }\n\n      .st3 {\n        fill: #f2da30;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </defs>\n  <path d=\"M221.86,92.96v33.68h81.96c14.69,0,33.73,17,36.68,31.43l29.5,175.64c.67,1.36-2.69,5.51-3.31,5.51h-19.84v26.57c0,1.71-4.29,4.83-6.33,4.15H43.29c-2.04.68-6.33-2.44-6.33-4.15v-26.57h-19.84c-.62,0-3.98-4.15-3.31-5.51l29.5-175.64c2.87-14.36,22.1-31.43,36.68-31.43h81.96v-33.68h-90.19c-32.7